# dictionaries-common's postinst reproducibly fails in this Docker
# chroot build environment (likely missing D-Bus during package
# configuration - see docs/offene-punkte.md). libreoffice-writer pulls
# in hunspell-en-us as a Recommends (not a hard dependency), which in
# turn drags in dictionaries-common. Recommends are best-effort, so
# pinning these specific packages to "not installable" just makes apt
# skip them instead of failing the whole transaction (unlike a hard
# dependency, where this would break resolution entirely).
Package: hunspell-en-us hunspell-de-de aspell aspell-en aspell-de dictionaries-common
Pin: release *
Pin-Priority: -1
